ive; upcoming earnings dates may also be drawing attention, while the evidence for a shared ICUI/HAE/BAX catalyst is unclear.", "rs_avg" : 78.8}, {"name" : "AI-Driven Diagnostics & Imaging Re-Rating", "stage" : "Fading", "parent_theme" : null, "source" : "live", "tickers" : ["PSNL","RDNT","TEM","CDNA","CAI","HTFL","ADPT","LH","DGX"], "score" : 68.8, "description" : "There’s no single shared catalyst: LH and RDNT have no fresh news identified; HTFL is riding strong results and analyst upgrades, while PSNL is benefiting from progress toward its Tempus acquisition. TEM’s recent updates include FDA clearances and oncology data, and CDNA’s earlier strength reflects strong earnings and finalized Medicare coverage for transplant tests—not a new catalyst this week.", "rs_avg" : 77.6}, {"name" : "Optical Laser & Photonic Materials for AI Transceivers", "stage" : "Nascent", "parent_theme" : null, "source" : "live", "tickers" : ["COHR","CIEN","FN","AAOI","AXTI","LITE"], "score" : 68.1, "description" : "The group’s rally is mainly a sector-wide bet on AI data-center buildouts driving demand for faster optical networking, reinforced by Bernstein’s new Outperform ratings on LITE, COHR and CIEN. Coherent’s PhotonLink AI-optics platform added a company-specific spark; FN, AAOI and AXTI are largely sympathy plays on the same demand theme.", "rs_avg" : 76.2}, {"name" : "Semiconductor Equipment & Materials Velocity Surge", "stage" : "Nascent", "parent_theme" : "Semiconductor Test, Yield & Assembly Supply Chain", "source" : "live", "tickers" : ["MKSI","ENTG","AEIS","ONTO","AXTI","UCTT"], "score" : 67.8, "description" : "The shared catalyst is a broader semiconductor-equipment rally on stronger AI and HBM investment expectations, reinforced by Micron’s upbeat results and forecast. Softer U.S. jobs data also eased rate concerns, supporting growth stocks; there’s no clear single company-specific catalyst common to all five.", "rs_avg" : 75.6}, {"name" : "Analog, Mixed-Signal & Power Semic